cket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245691138","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118500#issuecomment-4245691138","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118500","id":4245691138,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79EBsC","user":{"login":"Rawalanche","id":38806207,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM4ODA2MjA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/38806207?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche","html_url":"https://github.com/Rawalanche","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rawalanche/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T16:54:29Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T16:54:29Z","body":"> Consolidating in [godotengine/godot-proposals#9141](https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/9141) as this is a duplicate.\n> \n> Feel free to add relevant details there in support of that proposal. I'd ask you to watch your tone though and stay constructive, and not make judgemental comments about UX decisions such as \"irritating the user on purpose\". See [Code of Conduct](https://godotengine.org/code-of-conduct/).\n\nI genuinely meant that. There is just no other reason I can think of to intentionally call something distraction free mode and add distractions to it.\n\nIt's understandable if this would happen accidentally, for example as the UI panel system evolved. But it is simply not understandable to be aware of it and still call it by design.\n\nCan you honestly think of any way this would happen on purpose that would not consciously intend to worsen the UX?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245691138/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4245863761","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/118500#issuecomment-4245863761","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118500","id":4245863761,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc79Er1R","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-14T17:25:04Z","updated_at":"2026-04-14T17:25:04Z","body":"I'm not going to reply to strawman arguments.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":n